session Unpatched_Examples in Unpatched_Examples = HOL +
  description \<open>
    Counterexamples in Isabelle2026 without the patches of patches/, one theory per patch:
    lost unifiers and failed proof steps (01, 02, 03, 09), proofs of False (04, 05), a classic
    proof by assumption that does not check (10), a theorem with trivial flex-flex pairs (11) and
    a classic proof of generalize that does not reconstruct (12; 11 and 12 by Kappelmann and
    Huch), ill-typed tight proofs (13-19, 21), a tight proof of generalize with other variables
    than its theorem (22), a tight proof of forall_intr that proves another proposition (23) and a
    tight proof of unconstrainT that proves another proposition (24) and a tight proof of
    combination with an ill-typed instance of its axiom (25).
    The proofs of False for patches 07 and 08
    (Unpatched_07_Thm_Rename_Flexflex, Unpatched_08_Thm_Rename_Lifting, by Kappelmann and Huch,
    isabelle-users, 27 October 2026) are not part of the session: the installed Isabelle
    already contains these patches. Patches 06 (an adaptation of ZF) and 20 (no example) have no
    theory. Unpatched_Box_Instances shows a failure that no patch addresses: with tight proofs,
    Thm.instantiate raises ZTerm.BAD_INST on a theorem whose proof box has two variables of the
    same name. The theories set the global Proofterm.proofs, so they are processed one at a time.
  \<close>
  options [threads = 1]
  theories
    Unpatched_Base
    Unpatched_01_Pattern_Rigid_Occurs
    Unpatched_02_Unify_Rigid_Occurs
    Unpatched_03_Unify_Flexflex
    Unpatched_04_Unify_Cyclic
    Unpatched_05_Unify_Saturate
    Unpatched_09_Thm_Quick_Eres
    Unpatched_10_Thm_Assumption
    Unpatched_11_Thm_Flexflex_Trivial
    Unpatched_12_Thm_Generalize_Tpairs
    Unpatched_13_ZTerm_Ofclass
    Unpatched_14_ZTerm_Norm_Ofclass
    Unpatched_15_ZTerm_Lift_Frees
    Unpatched_16_ZTerm_Lift_Hyps
    Unpatched_17_ZTerm_Flatten
    Unpatched_18_ZTerm_Asm
    Unpatched_19_ZTerm_Assumption
    Unpatched_20_ZTerm_Hidden
    Unpatched_21_Thm_ZTerm_Rename
    Unpatched_22_ZTerm_Generalize_Clean
    Unpatched_23_ZTerm_Forall_Intr_Const
    Unpatched_24_ZTerm_Unconstrain
    Unpatched_25_ZTerm_Combination
    Unpatched_Box_Instances
